Hi,

as PK has pointed out, RKWard does not have a GUI for MDS, yet. And it's not
the only thing you'll find missing in the menus. But RKWard is based on a very
powerful statisticas system (R) and you can access all that functionality using
the RConsole. A useful starting point is the "Help Search" (at the bottom).
Searching for MDS, there, will point you to functions cmdscale() in package
stats, and isoMDS() in package MASS.

Juding by your name, you are likely German, so this more hands-on instruction
may be of interest to you:
http://www.wiwi.uni-bielefeld.de/~frohn/Mitarbeiter/Handl/mvamdsr.html .

Regards
Thomas

