Hi Maarten,

I know of no such way. However when you're done, you can save others the same
effort by looking for the section "[Katepart Shortcuts]" in the file
~/.kde/share/config/rkwardrc and posting the contents somewhere (e.g. in the
project wiki http://rkward.sourceforge.net/wiki). Then others can simply copy
and paste that section to get the same keybindings. Note, however, that in KDE
4 several of the actions in kate will have a different name, so most likely
you will need to reconfigure the shortcuts again, then.

Regards
Thomas

